ar of 1811 -- Kentucky sports --The Western boatmen -- Indian warfare -- Incidents of the War of 1812 in the West -- Visit to the mammoth cave -- Adventures of Oliver -- Incidents of Emigration -- The public domain -- The Ranger's adventure -- Wild Bill, or the Mississippi Orson -- The fanatical pilgrims -- The Missouri Compromise -- Adventure of Audubon -- Exploring expeditions of Long, Cass and Schoolcraft -- Life among the trappers -- Ogilvie's adventure -- Character of the Western people -- Fascinating life of the mountain hunter -- Adventure of a trapper -- The commerce of the prairies -- The Black Hawk War -- The pestilence, a frontier sketch -- The educated Indian trapper -- Life in the mountains of Virginia -- Fremont's expeditions -- Sketch of Mormonism -- The hunter's escape -- The Indians of the Great Prairie wilderness -- Effect of settlement on the climate of the West -- Historical and descriptive sketches of Texas, New Mexico, Oregon, California -- Terrible sufferings of a party of California emigrants -- Historical and descriptive sketch of Utah -- The Great Salt Desert of Utah -- Historical and descriptive sketch of Minnesota -- Washington Territory -- Nebraska and Kansas -- Pacific Railroad</dd>\n<dd>16</dd></dl>\n<br>Subjects:</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"93259166":{"pageid":93259166,"ns":6,"title":"File:The Illini trail, a pageant play commemorating the Illinois centennial (IA illinitrailpagea00youn).pdf","index":42,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":2402114,"width":831,"height":1314,"pagecount":40,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/The_Illini_trail%2C_a_pageant_play_commemorating_the_Illinois_centennial_%28IA_illinitrailpagea00youn%29.pdf/page1-500px-The_Illini_trail%2C_a_pageant_play_commemorating_the_Illinois_centennial_%28IA_illinitrailpagea00youn%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campai